{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.98] I told her, \"Ride it like a rental, it's just a rental\"\n[00:06.44] I'm not with all the sentimentals, like a rental\n[00:13.38] I told her, \"Ride it like a rental, just keep it simple\"\n[00:19.10] Uh, I told her, \"Ride it like a rental\" (Told her, \"Ride it like a rental\")\n[00:34.08] Skrrt, skrrt, skrrt, skrrt\n[00:51.84] After this song, we finna go ride some dirt bikes?\n[00:55.66] Lit\n[00:56.96] Uh-huh, in the Hills, fucking up all the happy houses\n[Verse 1]\n[01:00.10] I told her, \"Ride it like a rental, it's just a rental\"\n[01:02.66] I'm not with all the sentimentals, just keep it simple\n[01:05.28] You wanna know what I'm into so you can get into it\n[01:08.06] I ain't tryna get into it, I done been through it\n[01:10.60] A lot shit been on my mental, I done been through it\n[01:13.34] Niggas say they gon' kill me, Nike, just do it\n[01:15.98] Bitches say they want the real me, they sound real stupid\n[01:18.80] I already told you my relationship with Cupid\n[01:21.38] This shit don't ever work, my heart cold\n[01:23.74] It's been cold since I threw it to the South Pole\n[01:26.68] Uh, AP, two-tone, yeah, my wrist cold (Uh)\n[01:29.10] Straight flawless, the brightest of crystals (Uh)\n[01:31.82] I'm a diamond in the rough, that's a gem, ho (Uh)\n[01:34.40] Got a thing for Geminis with a bad soul (Uh)\n[01:37.16] I was taught to let live and to let 'em go (Uh)\n[01:39.70] But instead, I just love 'em and hold 'em close (Uh)\n[01:42.72] Opiate addict, yeah, it's fucking Narcos (Uh)\n[01:44.94] Heartbreak addict too, I've been done wrong (Uh)\n[01:47.60] Got a thing for the freaks and the snake hoes (Uh)\n[01:50.24] Love sex so much, need a porno (Uh)\n[01:52.40] Love head so much, need a deep throat (Uh)\n[01:55.34] I can't fuck with her if she don't got a deep throat (Uh)\n[01:58.12] Hundred-fifty for the watch, not a cheapo (Uh)\n[02:00.76] Cubic zirconias, you can keep those (Uh)\n[02:04.50] Uh, see a whole different side of me, ah-ha\n[02:07.38] Need a girl that'll die for me, ah-ha\n[02:09.82] Her boyfriend want a rivalry, ah-ha\n[02:12.26] That nigga better come ride for me, ah-ha\n[02:15.44] I remember when I couldn't get they time of day, now these hoes wanna spend they time with me, ah-ha\n[02:20.72] I remember being little, playing board games, now I'm playing real-life Monopoly, ah-ha\n[Bridge]\n[02:25.16] Cha-ching\n[02:30.60] Cha-ching\n[02:35.78] Cha-ching\n[02:37.78] I wake up in the morning\n[02:39.28] With a alarm clock in my head\n[02:41.94] It's a coach whistle, and (Ayy, ayy, ayy)\n[02:43.60] Something like a cash register, uh\n[02:44.82] Yeah, uh (Cha-ching)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:47.00] I don't got to come back 'cause I never left\n[02:49.30] I could only imagine how that feels, no disrespect (Uh)\n[02:52.32] On the right track, I don't ever go left\n[02:54.46] Need my millions upfront, yeah, plus a bonus\n[02:57.16] Had a big heart, uh, 'til a nigga sold it\n[02:59.80] Had a good soul, uh, 'til a nigga sold it\n[03:02.26] We came from the same place, I made it, you stayed\n[03:05.04] They wasn't gon' hear our story 'less a real nigga told it\n[03:07.68] Took his bitch, yeah, I stole her, I'm gettin' bolder\n[03:10.16] I'm sick, nigga, no Ebola, need a Ricola\n[03:12.80] She took my heart, yeah, she stole it, and now she own it\n[03:15.44] My heartbreak on the way, I'm good for the moment\n[03:18.10] I'm Tom Hanks with the play, Forrest Gump, runnin'\n[03:20.64] I get bad news everyday, gettin' high, just in case\n[03:23.54] Fake boobs to the face, good nudes, masturbate\n[03:26.18] How rude, baddie with an attitude, give me face\n[03:28.88] Attitude, I don't like her attitude\n[03:30.80] Let her swallow, she should have a attitude of gratitude\n[03:33.42] Bullets hollow, give 'em to a nigga like a attitude\n[03:36.38] .50-shot clip for a nigga with a attitude\n[03:38.80] Rolls-Royce truck, catch me cruisin' on the avenue\n[03:41.36] Good nut bust from some head, yeah, that'll do\n[03:43.86] I ain't Mr. T, nah, I never pity fools\n[03:46.74] I see how you living, to be honest, it's pitiful\n[03:49.50] I don't like much, I'm a chill dude, dude\n[03:52.52] Complicated, but it's kinda simple-le\n[03:55.18] Call my gun Proactiv, you a pimple-le\n[03:57.82] Catch me interacting with your bitch, ooh, ooh\n[04:00.46] Walk in the room, I'm too smooth\n[04:03.08] That's not me, that's the Percs, ooh, ooh-ooh\n[04:06.04] 'Til I die, I'ma work, ooh, ooh-ooh\n[04:08.38] Had to cut down on the syrup, ooh, ooh-ooh\n[Outro]\n[04:12.08] I was sleeping away money, couldn't wake up and get money\n[04:17.32] Now I'm up tryna get money, give a fuck what they want from me\n[04:22.30] I was too heart-broke to get money\n[04:24.56] Yeah, I'm sad, but I'm no dummy\n[04:27.54] If there's anything you should take from me\n[04:29.94] It's that I'm a confused, young, rich junkie (Young, rich junkie)","words":[[1.14,1.64,"[Intro]"],[1.98,1.98,"I"],[2.24,2.54,"told"],[2.9,3.06,"her,"],[3.24,3.46,"\"Ride"],[3.62,3.68,"it"],[3.72,3.98,"like"],[4.14,4.14,"a"],[4.24,4.76,"rental,"],[4.8,5.06,"it's"],[5.22,5.4,"just"],[5.46,5.46,"a"],[5.9,6.4,"rental\""],[6.44,6.88,"I'm"],[7.06,7.24,"not"],[7.88,8.22,"with"],[8.26,8.54,"all"],[8.72,8.76,"the"],[10.16,11.64,"sentimentals,"],[11.98,12.22,"like"],[12.38,12.38,"a"],[12.52,12.84,"rental"],[13.38,13.38,"I"],[14.26,14.62,"told"],[14.82,14.98,"her,"],[15.14,15.52,"\"Ride"],[15.72,15.82,"it"],[16.12,16.36,"like"],[16.52,16.52,"a"],[16.64,16.98,"rental,"],[17.28,17.48,"just"],[17.64,17.96,"keep"],[18.16,18.28,"it"],[18.44,18.98,"simple\""],[19.1,19.12,"Uh,"],[19.16,19.16,"I"],[19.44,19.76,"told"],[20.12,20.18,"her,"],[20.26,20.48,"\"Ride"],[20.64,20.76,"it"],[20.92,21.14,"like"],[21.32,21.32,"a"],[21.44,22.42,"rental\""],[31.18,31.34,"(Told"],[31.46,31.5,"her,"],[31.6,31.68,"\"Ride"],[31.72,31.74,"it"],[31.82,32.22,"like"],[33.04,33.04,"a"],[33.16,33.8,"rental\")"],[34.08,34.3,"Skrrt,"],[35.14,35.64,"skrrt,"],[37.88,3